inverseSubadmin.description:
If set, {@link FindUserInfo#subadmin} will look for all users and groups not managed by the
given user.
 Equivalent to {@link CheckoutUsersC#NOT_USERS_OF_SUBADMIN}

inverseGroup.description:
If set, {@link FindUserInfo#group} will look for all users and groups not members of the group
Equivalent to {@link CheckoutUsersC#NOT_MEMBERS_OF_GROUP_RAW} or
 {@link CheckoutUsersC#NOT_MEMBERS_OF_GROUP_RECURSIVE_RAW} with {@link FindUserInfo#groupRecursive}

